{
  "meta": {
    "name": "Effects tour: captions",
    "description": "Chapter 4 of the effects tour: title cards, every lower-third style (band, clean-bar, side-rule, kicker, stack-bars, pill), the caption sugar styles with balanced wrapping, and word-timed subtitles in all six caption DNAs with word / fill / pop karaoke, an SRT cue and a crowned payoff line.",
    "creativeDirection": "Text that names people, places and voices. Lower thirds and captions sit over bundled photographs so their legibility aids show; each subtitle DNA gets one line of copy that says what it does, timed like speech. Review: no lower third leaves the title-safe area, captions stay on at most two balanced lines, karaoke never runs ahead of its word, and the crown is the only enlarged line."
  },
